name=Perishable Foods: Vanilla Foods Expanded
id=PerishableFoodsVFX
description=Optional add-on for Perishable Foods. Needs Vanilla Foods Expanded. It gives the foods and drinks of that mod that never spoil a realistic but arcade shelf life, with the same rules as the main mod: spices last 2 years, candy, snacks and dry goods 1 year, cereal 6 months, packaged cakes 1 month, milk 2 months, juice 1 month, and fridges and freezers slow it down. Canned goods, sealed alcohol, sugar and salt are left alone. Turn it on only when both other mods are active.
